WEBVTT

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.250
How monstrous!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.720
Rei...

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.890
Dr. Isshiki, what on earth just happened?

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:04.390
That crow must be similar to the Alones.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:09.270
It used her arrows to raise its power!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.480
Rei... I'm so sorry!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.690
I couldn't protect you...

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:21.820
Akane...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.540
<i>Wonderful!</i>

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.040
<i>So this is the power of the arrows?</i>

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:26.060
<i>This power is just like theirs! No, possibly even greater!</i>

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:32.480
<i>From this moment on, I am the overlord of all spacetime!</i>

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.570
<i>I declare their time to be over!</i>

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.580
Dr. Isshiki, Chief Shijou, what on earth is going on?!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.330
I'm analyzing it! Pipe down!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:53.580
Impossible! All energy indicators show negative values!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.130
It's all negative energy opposite to the Vivid System!

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.170
Y-You can do something about it, right?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.220
No. There's no one on this planet that could stand against it.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:06.970
No way!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.100
Not even us?

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:11.600
I don't want to believe it...

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.360
What is this?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.690
I'm certain of it!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.940
This quantum waveform is identical to Kuroki Rei's!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.030
Right at the top!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.820
Rei!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:29.580
She's still alive inside it!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.830
Rei's inside that?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.590
<i>You have finally awakened.</i>

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.510
Where am I?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:51.020
<i>Be grateful. I've become the overlord of all spacetime, and you are now inside my body.</i>

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.100
Inside your body?

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:58.310
<i>Using the power of your arrows, I've transcended to a higher dimension.</i>

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.070
<i>Rei.</i>

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.110
You took my arrows?!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.190
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.820
Give them back!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.570
Give them back now!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.160
<i>we no longer have any use for you.</i>

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.830
<i>I could dispose of you now, if I so desired.</i>

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>Let me show you something fascinating.</i>

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.920
<i>Rei!</i>

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.800
<i>Kuroki!</i>

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.010
Rei!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:35.100
<i>As the sole overlord of all spacetime, I hereby decree judgment upon you.</i>

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.060
<i>This planet shall be erased.</i>

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:42.280
<i>I will destroy any future this planet had and return it to void.</i>

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.530
You plan on erasing Earth?!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.700
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:49.990
<i>Using the very thing you tried to protect so much...</i>

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.240
No way! The Manifestor Engine?!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.290
<i>Judgment will be carried out.</i>

00:05:55.910 --> 00:06:01.420
<i>Watch as your planet is obliterated!</i>

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.920
Obliterated?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.720
What the heck?

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:25.780
Dr. Isshiki, could it really erase Earth?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:33.740
If its negative force field merged with the Engine's positive field and ran wild, it might be possible.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:39.000
With great power comes great responsibility.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.040
That's why they were tested us.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:46.550
So this is how it ends...

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.420
Gramps...

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.980
This is Rei's key...

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.480
What?

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.610
The SDF is attempting to take it on with <i>those</i>?

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.290
The Alone is undamaged!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.800
It's ionizing its surroundings on the way to the Manifestor Engine!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.970
Not even SGE bombs work against it...

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.010
No way...

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.020
We're done for.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.270
I'm so sorry, Isshiki.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.690
It's all my fault...

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.990
Dr. Isshiki...

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.030
I'm sorry.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:42.910
I designed the Manifestor Engine to bring peace to the world,

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.080
but now there's nothing I can do.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.340
It's all over!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.590
It's not over yet!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.510
Akane?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.270
I'll go and give her this key!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.310
Wait!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.600
Your powers won't work against it anymore!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.600
She's right!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:10.440
The chance of you winning is zero!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.610
I'll be fine.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.820
I'm not alone.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:21.620
We've won fights that you said we couldn't.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.000
We could do it because we were all together.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:29.380
No matter how powerful your sensors may be, the power of our friendship can't be measured!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.300
Together we can even save the world!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.680
Girls!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.890
We'll be back!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.030
Don't worry, Momo.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.070
Have faith in your sister and her friends.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.850
The Alone will reach Blue Island soon!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.570
It's interfering with the Manifestor Core from the outside!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.320
It's siphoning out the energy!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.040
Supply rate down to ten percent!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.500
The entire world is being drained of energy!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.210
The world... is shutting down...

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:22.410
<i>Rei, do you know how planets die?</i>

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.450
<i>It's almost a little like the way a bubble bursts.</i>

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.370
<i>They both explode and vanish suddenly.</i>

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.750
<i>Nothing is left behind.</i>

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.590
<i>Just like your world.</i>

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:43.010
Please! Even if my world won't return,

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.430
leave this one alone!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:52.060
You can't erase the world with my friends in it!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:01.700
What's that?

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.620
It's even bigger than before!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.750
The Pallet Suits are powered by the Engine,

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.500
so if we don't hurry, we won't be able to fight it!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:16.750
This needs to be settled quickly.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:20.010
We've gotta do something about its wings.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.630
Those beams should be our first priority.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:27.010
Let's attack it with everything we've got!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:28.140
Yeah!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.520
Wait for us, Rei!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.150
They're crazy!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:43.490
<i>Know your place, you inferior beings!</i>

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.370
Akane!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:19.060
VividEngine! Release safety!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.950
Vivid Collider!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.030
Final Operation!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:42.210
<i>Mongrel! You dare scratch me?!</i>

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.060
Himawari!

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.100
Wakaba!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.310
It's your turn now, Wakaba!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.650
Akane!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.540
<i>You vermin!</i>

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.130
<i>You'll rue the day you crossed me!</i>

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.930
Vivid Blade!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.390
Final Operation!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.400
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.030
Why?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.290
Wakaba!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.450
What are you two doing?

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.790
Kuroki's right in front of you!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:03.840
Akane!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:23.730
<i>Why would you risk everything to pierce me?</i>

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.730
<i>Is saving Kuroki Rei worth that much?</i>

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.900
<i>How utterly foolish!</i>

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.110
It's not foolish!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.370
We're friends!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.240
So...

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.620
we're gonna...

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.750
save Rei, no matter what!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.770
Aoi!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.610
Go, Akane!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.270
Save Rei!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.220
Rei!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.350
Akane!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.100
<i>Stop right there!</i>

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.770
VividRed Operation!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:30.020
<i>Impossible! That is the light of creation!</i>

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.780
<i>Why is it in the possession of a human?!</i>

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.280
This is the power of friendship!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.070
<i>I will not tolerate this.</i>

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.700
<i>I am the pinnacle of this universe...</i>

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:47.080
<i>No. I am the pinnacle of </i>every<i> universe in existence.</i>

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:54.550
An event horizon has appeared around it!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.050
It contains enough energy to destroy the entire universe!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.650
<i>You cannot escape.</i>

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:13.530
<i>Your power will disappear along with this universe!</i>

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.410
We're not running away.
We're not running away.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:42.260
<i>Fall before me, you weak human!</i>

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:49.230
Vivid Punch!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.490
Final Operation!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.060
Akane!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.060
Kuroki...

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.110
They did it.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:20.570
I've still got a long way to go.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:26.580
When people shut themselves in and refuse to accept others, they are bound to their own limits.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:33.580
But if they live and grow with others, those limits no longer exist.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.090
I'll have to start my research again from scratch.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:47.890
I learned everything about you when we docked, Rei.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.180
I learned everything about you too, Akane.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:59.360
And through her heart, I've come to understand the three of you as well.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.240
Rei...

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.990
Rei!

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.250
What's that?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.010
Rei, could you hear it too?

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.390
Isn't that great?

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.480
They're gonna fix it all for you!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:38.150
They're gonna let you go back to your own world!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.360
I guess this is goodbye...

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:47.990
Akane...

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:58.250
A door!

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:02.590
Rei!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:04.920
Here.

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:26.820
My world!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:34.740
Akane...

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.620
It's okay!

00:22:37.370 --> 00:22:40.880
I'm sure we can meet again sometime!

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.210
We promised, didn't we?

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:47.470
Yeah!

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:50.430
It'll be okay, Rei!

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:52.550
Even if we're apart...

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.720
We'll be friends forever!

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:10.860
Goodbye!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.990
See you again!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.750
Yeah! See you again!

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:21.750
Let's meet again!

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.710
It's a promise!

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:25.750
We'll be waiting!

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:35.560
Rei!

00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:56.640
Vroom, vroom, vroom-r-room...

00:24:56.970 --> 00:25:00.890
All day, every day, vroom-vroom with Doggy...

00:25:00.890 --> 00:25:04.640
Delivering newspapers vroom-r-room...

00:25:04.640 --> 00:25:10.650
We can't fly high, but we're brave and happy!

00:25:13.740 --> 00:25:15.490
Hello?

00:25:15.490 --> 00:25:17.870
<i>Hey Akane, breakfast's ready!</i>

00:25:19.160 --> 00:25:19.620
'Kay!

00:25:22.450 --> 00:25:27.750
Good morning!
